WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:06.250
I can't afford to carelessly 
lay out grade 0 units...

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.390
Not against his deck...

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.440
The card that beat Brother 
Aichi is in that deck!

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.180
Right now, I have to get my hand 
ready and gather powerful units!

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:25.290
I see. It seems you're not the reckless type.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.360
Oh, you're finally looking at me, huh?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.220
Better not underestimate me just 'cause 
it's my first time playin' here!

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:36.300
I'm gonna show you what Kamui 
Katsuragi of Team Q4 is capable of!

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.150
I stand and draw.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.660
I ride Werwolf Sieger.  {sic}

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.290
I call one more Werwolf 
and Dark Soul Conductor.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.800
I call Alluring Succubus.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:44.740
I activate Alluring Succubus's 
skill. Soulcharge.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.450
Go, Werwolf!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.820
Street Bouncer intercepts!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.030
Attack!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.640
No guard!

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.830
Drive check.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.610
Damage check!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.890
With a boost from Alluring Succubus...

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.560
Dark Soul Conductor attacks.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.540
That's the end of my turn.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:52.820
Wall of the General

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.430
I stand and draw.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.010
Kamui the Great rides Top Gun!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.620
I call Jack!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:15.000
Jack's Counterblast. Rev into high gear!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.370
Here I go!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.080
With a boost from Shout...

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.010
Jack attacks Dark Soul Conductor!

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.220
With a boost from Death Army Guy...

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.800
Death Army Lady attacks!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.970
I guard with Dark Queen of Nightmareland!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:55.370
Hmph. In that case, I attack with Top Gun!

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.530
Twin Drive, first card...

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.780
Critical trigger!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.590
I add +5000 to the power 
of Death Army Lady...

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.860
...and give the extra critical to Top Gun!

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:10.950
Second card!

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:13.090
Lucky!

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.840
LK, yo!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.580
Even though he didn't get a trigger?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.100
It's because he drew a grade 3 card!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:22.100
With Death Army Lady and Death Army Guy,

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.700
if a grade 3 unit is drawn 
during a Vanguard drive check,

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.280
they can stand.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.530
Hey! That's what I was just about to say!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.740
So that's why he gave 5000 
power to Death Army Lady.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:38.550
If all goes well, he might be able to do 
lots of damage all at once this turn!

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.440
I was gonna say that, too!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.920
Go, Top Gun!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:01.020
Damage check. First card...

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:03.700
Second card...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.310
Draw trigger.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.090
I add +5000 to the power of Werwolf.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.140
And then I draw!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.350
Katsuragi and Shinjou both have 4 damage!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.310
How long will this tie last?!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.220
Death Army Guy boosts!

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.620
I use Lady...

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:35.080
...to attack your rear-guard Werwolf!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.180
Kamui the Great?

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.700
WDT?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.970
Um... "Why do that?"

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.840
What's the point of wasting his good luck?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.190
Yep, unlike me, that kid is hopeless.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.390
Actually, he's pretty crafty.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.770
Kamui, did you...?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:07.400
Now I activate Vampir's other skill!

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:11.110
Counterblast and Soulblast!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.870
Stil Vampir...

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.820
moves Llew from your rear-guard 
to the Vanguard circle!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:26.400
He averted 5 damage to protect 
himself against Vampir's skill.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.380
This boy...

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:40.350
Brother, hang in there!!

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.480
Kamui!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:47.250
I see. You were there last time...

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:52.940
Not on the field, but together with Team Q4.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.170
Y-Yeah...

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:59.000
What the heck?! He's bringing 
up one of my worst moments!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.060
This guy really is a jerk!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:06.670
At that time, I'd run away from my team.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.150
Ah! But I will tell you this...

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:14.190
It wasn't because I was nervous about 
the national championship or anything!

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:16.050
I was oversinking about the team...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.160
No, I mean, I was overthinking!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:23.960
But in the end, it only 
caused problems for them.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:28.860
Darn it! Why did I even do that?!

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.820
I was sneaking around, hiding,

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:42.710
so even when my teammates were in a 
pinch, I couldn't rush right over.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.390
So, of course...

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:53.930
My place with the team and 
my teammates' trust...

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:57.580
I tossed that all away.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:08:59.760
That's why

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:04.010
I'm here, today, to earn 
my teammates' trust back.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:07.120
This time, no matter what 
happens, I ain't gonna run away!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.800
I'm gonna help my teammates, too!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:18.200
And then my team, Q4, 
is definitely gonna win!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.250
Kamui...

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.750
Spoken like a real man.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.900
Almost as manly as me...

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.130
Morikawa!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.560
This mouth has no right to say those words!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.920
NRTS!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.270
Kamui...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.010
Ah, youth...

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.000
And how old are <i>you</i>?

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:48.090
Hey, you lose that straightforwardness 
pretty early on.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.190
See, the stronger the man, 
the more awkward he is.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.630
Stand and draw.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.790
I see...

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.620
So you do have experience, in a way.

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:29.940
Wicked wings, flap in the darkness!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.770
I ride...

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.400
Stil Vampir!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:58.230
Vampir gains +2000 power from a Soulcharge.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:02.460
Boy, you guarded against Stil Vampir's skill

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:06.290
so I couldn't get a 5th point of 
damage, and I commend you for that.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.520
But...

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.940
I call Gwynn the Ripper!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.940
I activate Gwynn the Ripper's skill!

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:17.440
Counterblast!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.400
You paid the cost?!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:24.630
When this unit is called, if a 
Dark Irregulars is the Vanguard,

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:28.040
one of the opponent's grade 2 or 
lower rear-guards can be retired!

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:37.090
I call Demon of Aspiration, Amon

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:40.260
and Poet of Darkness, Amon!

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:47.830
For both of these units, if there are 
six or more Dark Irregulars in the Soul,

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.490
they have +3000 power this turn!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:58.360
I attack with Demon of Aspiration, 
Amon, boosted by Poet of Darkness, Amon!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.410
Damage check!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.150
Even if you did manage to avoid one skill,

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:15.310
you're going to have the same 
outcome as Aichi Sendou.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.380
Attack!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.990
Twin drive...

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.950
Kamui the Great is going to win!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:01.260
Katsuragi used a perfect defense!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.970
Which protected him wonderfully against the 
General's fer-<i>o</i>-cious attack, didn't it?

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:07.720
Were you worried?

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:11.000
Yeah. But he'll be okay, right?

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.930
After all, look how hard 
he's working for the team.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:18.190
Besides, right before he left, 
he promised that he'd win.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.560
Kamui the Great, the 
goddess believes in you!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.200
FK! Fight, Kamui!

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:31.790
Pretty impressive, boy.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:35.230
I don't need your approval!

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:39.750
'Cause AL4 Foo Fighter ticks me off!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.580
Like "Victory is everything"...

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.560
Or "I'll never forgive failure 
from one of our own"...

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:49.640
What do you guys think teammates are?!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.750
Teammates?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:55.900
If you lose or make a mistake, you support 
each other and move forward together!

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:57.690
That's what a teammate is!

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:05.440
You're naive.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.740
With a boost from Alluring Succubus...

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.220
I guard with Fighting Battleship, Prometheus!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.300
My turn is over.

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.300
Stand and draw!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:37.060
Kamui the Great rides Asura Kaiser!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:52.530
His hand and an intercept... I might 
be able to break through them!

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:56.540
I call Tough Boy and Ring Girl, Clara!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:03.420
Uh oh! Katsuragi has used up his hand!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.240
He even called Clara with her 10000 shield...

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:11.690
Looks like his strategy is to ride a unit that can 
increase the number of attacks, then steal damage...

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:16.930
Kamui means to put everything 
on the line this turn.

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:21.480
Here I go!

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:24.010
Jack revs up to full speed!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.200
With a boost from Shout, he attacks!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.770
Go!!

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.300
Damage check.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:41.750
Stand trigger!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:45.500
Demon of Aspiration, Amon stands!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.280
I add +5000 to the power of Vampir!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.090
He powered it up!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.630
If he survives this turn, Kamui's in trouble!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.180
Oh, no...

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.600
Wait, he still has a chance!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.470
With a boost from Tough Boy...

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.350
Death Army Lady attacks!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.230
Guard!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:14.330
Skill activated! Soulcharge!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.750
Next!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.200
With a boost from Clara...

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.700
Asura Kaiser attacks!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.210
I guard with Blitzritter!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.070
Twin drive, first card!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.420
Death Army Lady stands!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:32.080
Then, with Asura Kaiser's 
skill, I choose Tough Boy...

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:32.920
Stand!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.590
Second card!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:38.280
No good...

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.530
I don't have enough power!

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.570
With a boost from Tough Boy...

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.740
Death Army Lady attacks 
Demon of Aspiration, Amon!

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.540
That's the end of my turn.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.080
Oh, my goodness!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.660
Katsuragi couldn't break 
through Shinjou's iron wall!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.970
<i>Oh</i>, he's in a real heart-pounding pinch!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.850
It's all over!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.970
If he can protect himself through the 
next turn, he'll be all right, won't he?

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:25.600
Y-Yeah, that's right...

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.370
But with this opponent...

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.350
Kamui, good luck!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.450
Goddess's blessing, reach him!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:38.130
KTG, Kamui the Great!!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.810
Stand and draw!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:47.280
Sinful king praying for dark prosperity...

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.320
King who has embraced the despair 
of light in those wings...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.460
The time has come for you to awaken!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:55.900
I ride...

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:59.290
King of Diptera, Beelzebub!

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:26.480
If there are eight or more cards in the 
Soul, Beelzebub receives +1000 power.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.390
I call Dark Soul Conductor!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.040
With a boost from Alluring Succubus...

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.190
Gwynn the Ripper attacks!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.700
Are you prepared, boy?

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.680
What's with that?!

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.530
I don't know what you mean!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.220
You don't know the word "resignation"?

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.480
Don't know it and don't need it!

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.270
I've got teammates!

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:06.460
And as long as I got them, 
I ain't never gonna give up!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.380
But you wouldn't understand 
that feeling, huh?!

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.260
If you get hung up on that stuff,

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:24.890
you'll never get to be the strongest!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.030
I attack with Beelzebub!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.100
Counterblast!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.970
I choose two rear-guard 
units to give +3000 power!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:40.320
I select Dark Soul Conductor 
and Poet of Darkness, Amon!

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:50.710
Twin drive, first card.

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:52.580
Second card...

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.790
Critical trigger!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.840
Tremble in eternal darkness!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.340
Deepest Corruption!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.560
Kamui!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:17.820
Kamui the Great!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.820
Miss Emi...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.390
Kamui...

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.280
The winner of the first match...

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:37.560
Tetsu Shinjou of Team AL4!

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.080
Farewell, Kamui Katsuragi.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.270
My name...

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.490
That doesn't make me happy!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:54.030
Teammates, huh?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.120
So you came... Kai?

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:10.740
I'm sorry, Brother, Misaki...

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.880
I wanted to win more than anything.

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.920
I wanted to win!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.430
But... I...

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:21.690
It was a nice fight, Kamui.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.300
Leave the rest to us. We're teammates, right?

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:39.610
I promised Miss Emi that I would win, too.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:43.090
I'm so lame!

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.670
It was close...

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:50.170
Yeah, the little brat did well.

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:52.530
Yep. You did really well, Kamui...

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:55.640
That's right, Kamui!

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:57.250
You were really cool!

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:00.610
Second Match

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:00.680
On to the second match!

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:01.740
Asaka Narumi                Misaki Tokura

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.530
From AL4, Asaka Narumi!

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:10.960
And from Team Q4, Misaki Tokura!

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:55.510
Brother, Misaki, I'm sorry. I lost!

00:23:55.510 --> 00:23:58.280
You did your best, Kamui. 
You were really cool!

00:23:58.280 --> 00:24:01.630
That's right. And your opponent 
was AL4's Tetsu Shinjou.

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:03.190
You should be proud.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.790
But I wanted to win...

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.930
Misaki, I'm counting on you!

00:24:07.930 --> 00:24:09.660
Right! I'll win for sure!

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:12.770
Your revenge match with Asaka... 
Makes you nervous, huh?

00:24:12.770 --> 00:24:13.180
Yeah!

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:15.780
Next time: Feelings Towards Foo Fighter

00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:18.690
I'm getting an image of Misaki's victory!
